An interface whose DEVICE is not a device name.

vrmr_read_interface_info() drops the value and deactivates the interface: one
typo in one file must not cost the operator the other interfaces, and the rest
of the tree must not see the word. So the load has to succeed and the artifact
must carry no -i, chain name or tc line built from it.

The five "write: /proc/sys/net/ipv4/conf/eth;0/... = 9" lines are not that: they
come from the fake /proc the harness builds from the state files and from the
restore-the-defaults sweep over every conf directory present. At the base of
this branch the same case also put the word in rule lines - those are what the
golden is about.
